ng-c131964840="" class="ng-tns-c131964840-59">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c131964840-59"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c131964840-59 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1156049544="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1156049544="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1156049544="" _nghost-ng-c1463213052="" id="message-content-id-r_1dea0d3594a7949d" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1463213052="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_1dea0d3594a7949d" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">在正常情况下，<b>Spring AOP 拦截的方法只会执行一次</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">AOP 的核心机制是“代理模式”（Proxy Pattern）。当一个请求进来时，代理对象会按照顺序执行“前置通知”、“环绕通知”、“后置通知”等，最后才调用一次真正的目标方法。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">如果你发现被拦截的方法执行了<b>两次</b>，通常是以下几种常见原因导致的：</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 最常见原因：<code>@Around</code> (环绕通知) 写法错误</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">这是最容易发生“执行两次”的地方。在 <code>@Around</code> 通知中，你需要手动调用 <code>point.proceed()</code> 来触发目标方法。如果你不小心写了两次调用，或者逻辑控制不当，目标方法就会运行两次。</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b>错误的写法示例：</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-94 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4103393053-94 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1dea0d3594a7949d&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fd18fab351aba8e2&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiW6Obizr-RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwgE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4103393053-94 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-94">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4103393053-94 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4103393053-94 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1dea0d3594a7949d&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fd18fab351aba8e2&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4103393053-94"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4103393053-94"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-94"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4103393053-94"><span class="hljs-meta">@Around("execution(* com.example.service.*.*(..))")</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> Object <span class="hljs-title">logAround</span><span class="hljs-params">(ProceedingJoinPoint joinPoint)</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">throws</span> Throwable </span>{
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 第一次调用</span>
    joinPoint.proceed(); 
    
    System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"Doing something..."</span>);
    
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 第二次调用（导致目标方法被执行两遍）</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> joinPoint.proceed(); 
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="8"><b>正确的写法：</b>
<code>proceed()</code> 应该只被调用一次，并将其返回值返回。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-95 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4103393053-95 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1dea0d3594a7949d&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fd18fab351aba8e2&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiW6Obizr-RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwwE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4103393053-95 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-95">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4103393053-95 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4103393053-95 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1dea0d3594a7949d&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fd18fab351aba8e2&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button