ype="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1156049544="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1156049544="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1156049544="" _nghost-ng-c1463213052="" id="message-content-id-r_5cf9f45e2b5fe79d" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1463213052="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_5cf9f45e2b5fe79d" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个用于监控 <code>ThreadPoolTaskExecutor</code> 实时状态的实用方案。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">在生产环境中，<b>“队列积压数量”</b>（Queue Size）和 <b>“活跃线程数”</b>（Active Count）是最关键的两个指标。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">方案一：定时日志监控 (最简单直接)</h3><p data-path-to-node="3">这个组件会每隔一段时间（比如 30 秒）在日志中打印一次线程池的健康状况。把它放到你的项目中即可生效。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-180 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4103393053-180 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5cf9f45e2b5fe79d&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1c204939553e45f6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiW6Obizr-RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsAI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4103393053-180 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-180">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4103393053-180 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4103393053-180 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5cf9f45e2b5fe79d&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1c204939553e45f6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4103393053-180"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4103393053-180"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-180"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4103393053-180"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.slf4j.Logger;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.slf4j.LoggerFactory;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Qualifier;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.scheduling.annotation.Scheduled;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent.ThreadPoolTaskExecutor;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.stereotype.Component;

<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor;

<span class="hljs-meta">@Component</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">ThreadPoolMonitor</span> </span>{

    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">final</span> Logger log = LoggerFactory.getLogger(ThreadPoolMonitor.class);

    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">final</span> ThreadPoolTaskExecutor executor;

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 注入我们在 AsyncConfiguration 中定义的 Bean</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-title">ThreadPoolMonitor</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-meta">@Qualifier("asyncTaskExecutor")</span> ThreadPoolTaskExecutor executor)</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-keyword">this</span>.executor = executor;
    }

    <span class="hljs-comment">/**
     * 每 30 秒打印一次线程池状态
     */</span>
    <span class="hljs-meta">@Scheduled(fixedRate = 30000)</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">monitor</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 获取底层的 java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor</span>
        ThreadPoolExecutor coreExecutor = executor.getThreadPoolExecutor();

        <span class="hljs-keyword">int</span> activeCount = coreExecutor.getActiveCount();
        <span class="hljs-keyword">int</span> corePoolSize = coreExecutor.getCorePoolSize();
        <span class="hljs-keyword">int</span> maxPoolSize = coreExecutor.getMaxPoolSize();
        <span class="hljs-keyword">int</span> poolSize = coreExecutor.getPoolSize();
        <span class="hljs-keyword">long</span> completedTaskCount = coreExecutor.getCompletedTaskCount();
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 关键：获取队列当前的积压数量</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">int</span> queueSize = coreExecutor.getQueue().size();
        <span class="hljs-keyword">int</span> remainingCapacity = coreExecutor.getQueue().remainingCapacity();

        log.info(<span class="hljs-string">"【线程池监控】活跃线程: {}/{}, 当前池大小: {}, 核心: {}, 队列积压: {} (剩余容量: {}), 已完成任务: {}"</span>,
                activeCount, maxPoolSize, poolSize, corePoolSize, queueSize, remainingCapacity, completedTaskCount);
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 简单的告警逻辑示例</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (queueSize &gt; <span class="hljs-number">400</span>) { <span class="hljs-comment">// 假设队列总容量是 500</span>
            log.warn(<span class="hljs-string">"⚠️ 警告：线程池队列积压严重！当前积压：{}"</span>, queueSize);
        }
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="5"><b>日志输出示例：</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-181 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4103393053-181 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5cf9f45e2b5fe79d&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1c204939553e45f6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiW6Obizr-RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsQI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4103393053-181 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-181">Plaintext</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4103393053-181 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4103393053-181 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5cf9f45e2b5fe79d&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1c204939553e45f6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4103393053-181"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4103393053-181"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-181"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4103393053-181">INFO  【线程池监控】活跃线程: 5/32, 当前池大小: 16, 核心: 16, 队列积压: 12 (剩余容量: 488), 已完成任务: 1024
