n-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button more-button ng-tns-c895538348-234 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-92" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c895538348="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="response-content ng-tns-c895538348-234"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c131964840="" class="ng-tns-c131964840-236 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c131964840-236 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c131964840-236"><button _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c131964840-236 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c131964840-236"><span _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="ng-tns-c131964840-236">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c131964840-236"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c131964840-236 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1156049544="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1156049544="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1156049544="" _nghost-ng-c1463213052="" id="message-content-id-r_e022c86435b33c00" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1463213052="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_e022c86435b33c00" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">除了 <code>ConfigurationClassPostProcessor</code>，Spring 生态中确实还有几个非常著名且关键的类实现了 <code>BeanDefinitionRegistryPostProcessor</code> 或 <code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">它们通常扮演着 <b>“基础设施建设者”</b> 的角色：在业务 Bean 创建之前，负责解析配置、扫描特殊组件或修改 Bean 的定义。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">我把它们分为 <b>Spring 内置</b> 和 <b>第三方框架常用</b> 两类来介绍。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">一、 Spring 内置的核心处理器</h3><h4 data-path-to-node="5">1. <code>PropertySourcesPlaceholderConfigurer</code> (非常重要)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b>身份：</b> <code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b>功能：</b> <b>处理配置文件占位符 (<code>${...}</code>)</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0"><b>工作原理：</b>
它会在所有的 <code>BeanDefinition</code> 加载完毕后，遍历它们，检查谁的属性值里写了 <code>${jdbc.url}</code> 这种占位符，然后去 <code>application.properties</code> 或环境变量里找到对应的值，把它<b>替换</b>掉。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,0"><b>与 <code>ConfigurationClassPostProcessor</code> 的区别：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,3,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,1,0,0"><code>Configuration...</code> 负责<b>注册</b> Bean（无中生有）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,1,1,0"><code>Property...</code> 负责<b>修改</b> Bean 的属性值（偷天换日）。</p></li></ul></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="7">2. <code>EventListenerMethodProcessor</code></h4><ul data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><b>身份：</b> <code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><b>功能：</b> <b>解析 <code>@EventListener</code> 注解</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,2,0"><b>工作原理：</b>
它会遍历容器中所有的 Bean 定义，看谁的方法上加了 <code>@EventListener</code>。如果发现了，它不会修改这个 Bean，而是会<b>额外注册</b>一个 <code>ApplicationListener</code> 的适配器 Bean，专门用来监听事件并回调这个方法。</p></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="9">3. <code>CustomAutowireConfigurer</code> (较少见)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="10"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,0,0"><b>身份：</b> <code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0"><b>功能：</b> 允许你注册自定义的 <code>@Qualifier</code> 注解类型，主要用于非常复杂的依赖注入场景。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="11"><h3 data-path-to-node="12">二、 第三方框架中的经典应用 (面试加分项)</h3><p data-path-to-node="13">这部分是你最容易在实际项目中遇到的，特别是在集成 <b>MyBatis</b> 或 <b>RPC 框架</b> 时。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="14">1. <code>MapperScannerConfigurer</code> (MyBatis)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="15"><li><p data-path-to-node="15,0,0"><b>身份：</b> <code>BeanDefinitionRegistryPostProcessor</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,1,0"><b>功能：</b> <b>把 Interface 变成 Bean</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,2,0"><b>场景：</b> 为什么你只写了一个 <code>UserMapper</code> 接口，没有写实现类，却能直接 <code>@Autowired</code>？</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,3,0"><b>原理：</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="15,3,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="15,3,1,0,0">它实现 <code>postProcessBeanDefinitionRegistry</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,3,1,1,0">扫描指定的包路径（<code>@MapperScan</code>）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,3,1,2,0">找到所有的接口。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,3,1,3,0">为每个接口生成一个 <code>BeanDefinition</code>，但是把 <code>beanClass</code> 设置为 <b><code>MapperFactoryBean</code></b>（一个工厂 Bean）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,3,1,4,0">最终运行时，由这个工厂生产出代理对象。</p></li></ol></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="16">2. FeignClient / Dubbo 扫描器</h4><ul data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0">原理与 MyBatis 几乎一模一样。它们都需要在 Spring 启动早期，扫描特定的注解（<code>@FeignClient</code>, <code>@DubboReference</code>），然后动态注册代理 Bean 到容器中，这样你才能注入远程服务的存根。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="18"><h3 data-path-to-node="19">三、 总结对比表</h3><p data-path-to-node="20">为了让你更清晰，我把这些大佬们做一个横向对比：</p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c280977563="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c280977563="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c280977563="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwiW6Obizr-RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhQM"><table data-path-to-node="21"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="21,0,0,0">类名</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,0,1,0">接口类型</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,0,2,0">核心作用</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,0,3,0">形象比喻</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="21,1,0,0"><b>ConfigurationClassPostProcessor</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,1,1,0">RegistryPostProcessor</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,1,2,0">解析 <code>@Configuration</code>, <code>@Bean</code>, <code>@ComponentScan</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,1,3,0"><b>总设计师</b> (画出所有图纸)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="21,2,0,0"><b>MapperScannerConfigurer</b> (MyBatis)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,2,1,0">RegistryPostProcessor</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,2,2,0">扫描接口，注册 Mapper 代理</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,2,3,0"><b>外包工头</b> (把外部接口拉进项目)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="21,3,0,0"><b>PropertySourcesPlaceholderConfigurer</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,3,1,0">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,3,2,0">替换 <code>${...}</code> 占位符</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,3,3,0"><b>填空员</b> (把图纸上的空白填上数据)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="21,4,0,0"><b>EventListenerMethodProcessor</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,4,1,0">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,4,2,0">处理事件监听方法</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,4,3,0"><b>布线员</b> (连接报警器和响应系统)</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c280977563="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c280977563="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_e022c86435b33c00&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c280977563="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="22"><h3 data-path-to-node="23">四、 什么时候你需要自己写一个？</h3><p data-path-to-node="24">通常在业务开发中很少需要实现这两个接口，但在<b>中间件开发</b>或<b>基础架构开发</b>中非常常见。</p><p data-path-to-node="25"><b>场景示例：</b>
假设你们公司有一个内部配置系统（非 Nacos/Apollo），通过 HTTP 接口拉取配置，并且需要根据配置里的 JSON <b>动态生成</b> 一批 Service Bean。</p><p data-path-to-node="26"><b>怎么做？</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="27"><li><p data-path-to-node="27,0,0">写一个类实现 <code>BeanDefinitionRegistryPostProcessor</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,1,0">在 <code>postProcessBeanDefinitionRegistry</code> 方法里调用 HTTP 接口拿到 JSON。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,2,0">循环 JSON，手动构建 <code>GenericBeanDefinition</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,3,0">调用 <code>registry.registerBeanDefinition(name, definition)</code>。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="28"><b>一句话总结：</b>
如果你的需求是 <b>“在 Spring 开始实例化对象之前，动态地往容器里塞一些 Bean，或者修改已有的 Bean 定义”</b>，那么你就需要寻找或实现这两个接口的类。</p><p data-path-to-node="29"><b>您是否想了解一下，为什么很多教程说 <code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code> 中不要使用 <code>@Autowired</code> 注入业务 Bean？这里有一个很容易踩的坑。</b></p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c895538348="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c895538348-234"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c2607072150="" class="ng-tns-c2607072150-238 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2607072150="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c2607072150-238 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2607072150="" class="spacer ng-tns-c2607072150-238 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c2607072150="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c2607072150-238"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c2607072150="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c2607072150-238"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c1708826894="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->