我们希望达到这样的效果：<b>只定义一个接口，不用写实现类，就能直接 <code>@Autowired</code> 注入并运行。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">我们会用到三个核心组件：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b>注解</b> (<code>@MyRpcClient</code>)：标记哪些接口需要被扫描。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b>工厂 Bean</b> (<code>RpcFactoryBean</code>)：负责产生代理对象（因为接口不能直接实例化）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b>后置处理器</b> (<code>RpcScannerRegistryPostProcessor</code>)：<b>也就是本题的主角</b>，负责扫描并注册 Bean 定义。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">第一步：定义标记注解</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">这就好比 <code>@Mapper</code> 或 <code>@FeignClient</code>。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-270 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4103393053-270 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f7f3c5e375058a6f&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_06cf42211cb8cec8&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiW6Obizr-RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrwM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4103393053-270 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-270">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4103393053-270 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4103393053-270 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f7f3c5e375058a6f&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_06cf42211cb8cec8&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4103393053-270"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4103393053-270"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-270"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4103393053-270"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.lang.annotation.*;

<span class="hljs-meta">@Target(ElementType.TYPE)</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@Retention(RetentionPolicy.RUNTIME)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-meta">@interface</span> MyRpcClient {
    <span class="hljs-function">String <span class="hljs-title">name</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span> ""</span>;
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="8">第二步：定义工厂 Bean (FactoryBean)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">Spring 容器无法实例化接口，所以我们需要一个“工厂”来生产这个接口的 <b>JDK 动态代理对象</b>。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-271 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4103393053-271 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f7f3c5e375058a6f&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_06cf42211cb8cec8&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiW6Obizr-RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsAM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4103393053-271 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-271">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4103393053-271 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4103393053-271 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f7f3c5e375058a6f&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_06cf42211cb8cec8&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4103393053-271"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4103393053-271"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-271"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4103393053-271"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.FactoryBean;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.lang.reflect.InvocationHandler;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.lang.reflect.Method;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.lang.reflect.Proxy;

<span class="hljs-comment">// T 代表接口类型</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">RpcFactoryBean</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-title">T</span>&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title">FactoryBean</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-title">T</span>&gt; </span>{

    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> Class&lt;T&gt; interfaceType;

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 构造函数，由 Spring 在实例化时传入具体的接口 Class</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-title">RpcFactoryBean</span><span class="hljs-params">(Class&lt;T&gt; interfaceType)</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-keyword">this</span>.interfaceType = interfaceType;
    }

    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> T <span class="hljs-title">getObject</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">throws</span> Exception </span>{
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 【核心逻辑】这里利用 JDK 动态代理生成一个对象</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (T) Proxy.newProxyInstance(
            interfaceType.getClassLoader(),
            <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> Class[]{interfaceType},
            <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> InvocationHandler() {
                <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
                <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> Object <span class="hljs-title">invoke</span><span class="hljs-params">(Object proxy, Method method, Object[] args)</span> </span>{
                    <span class="hljs-comment">// 模拟 RPC 调用或者是 SQL 查询</span>
                    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">"【拦截成功】你调用了接口: "</span> + interfaceType.getSimpleName() 
                           + <span class="hljs-string">" 的方法: "</span> + method.getName();
                }
            }
        );
    }

    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> Class&lt;?&gt; getObjectType() {
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> interfaceType;
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="11"><h3 data-path-to-node="12">第三步：【核心】实现 BeanDefinitionRegistryPostProcessor</h3><p data-path-to-node="13">这是魔法发生的地方。我们需要扫描包，找到接口，然后把它们偷梁换柱变成 <code>RpcFactoryBean</code> 的定义。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-272 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4103393053-272 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f7f3c5e375058a6f&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_06cf42211cb8cec8&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiW6Obizr-RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsQM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4103393053-272 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-272">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4103393053-272 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4103393053-272 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f7f3c5e375058a6f&quot;,&quot;c_24c1e6ef0cac682c&quot;,null,&quot;rc_06cf42211cb8cec8&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4103393053-272"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4103393053-272"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" class="ng-tns-c4103393053-272"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4103393053="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4103393053-272"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.BeansException;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.support.AbstractBeanDefinition;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionBuilder;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionRegistry;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionRegistryPostProcessor;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.context.annotation.ClassPathScanningCandidateComponentProvider;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.core.type.filter.AnnotationTypeFilter;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.stereotype.Component;

<span class="hljs-meta">@Component</span> <span class="hljs-comment">// 让 Spring 启动时自动加载这个处理器</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">RpcScannerRegistryPostProcessor</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title">BeanDefinitionRegistryPostProcessor</span> </span>{

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 注册阶段：无中生有，扫描接口并注册</span>
    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">postProcessBeanDefinitionRegistry</span><span class="hljs-params">(BeanDefinitionRegistry registry)</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">throws</span> BeansException </span>{
        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"&gt;&gt;&gt; 开始扫描 @MyRpcClient 接口..."</span>);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 这里的扫描器是 Spring 提供的工具，专门用来扫描 Classpath</span>
        ClassPathScanningCandidateComponentProvider scanner = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> ClassPathScanningCandidateComponentProvider(<span class="hljs-keyword">false</span>) {
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 默认情况下 Spring 不扫描接口，重写这个方法让它允许接口通过检查</span>
            <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
            <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">protected</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">boolean</span> <span class="hljs-title">isCandidateComponent</span><span class="hljs-params">(org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.AnnotatedBeanDefinition beanDefinition)</span> </span>{
                <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> beanDefinition.getMetadata().isInterface();
            }
        };
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 设置过滤器：只扫描加了 @MyRpcClient 注解的</span>
        scanner.addIncludeFilter(<span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> AnnotationTypeFilter(MyRpcClient.class));

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 假设我们只扫描 "com.example.demo" 包 (实际中可以配置化)</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (org.springframework.beans.factory.config.BeanDefinition bd : scanner.findCandidateComponents(<span class="hljs-string">"com.example.demo"</span>)) {
            String interfaceName = bd.getBeanClassName();
            System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"&gt;&gt;&gt; 发现接口: "</span> + interfaceName);

            <span class="hljs-comment">// 【关键点】我们要创建一个 BeanDefinition</span>
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 但它的 class 不能是接口本身，而必须是我们的 RpcFactoryBean</span>
            BeanDefinitionBuilder builder = BeanDefinitionBuilder.genericBeanDefinition(RpcFactoryBean.class);
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 这里的 addConstructorArgValue 对应 RpcFactoryBean 的构造函数</span>
            builder.addConstructorArgValue(interfaceName);
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 设置为根据类型自动注入 (可选)</span>
            builder.setAutowireMode(AbstractBeanDefinition.AUTOWIRE_BY_TYPE);

            <span class="hljs-comment">// 注册到 Spring 容器！ Bean 的名字默认为接口全限定名</span>
            registry.registerBeanDefinition(interfaceName, builder.getBeanDefinition());
        }
    }

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 工厂处理阶段：通常留空，或者做属性修改</span>
    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">postProcessBeanFactory</span><span class="hljs-params">(ConfigurableListableBeanFactory beanFactory)</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">throws</span> BeansException </span>{
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 在这个简单的 Demo 中，我们不需要修改已有的 Bean 定义，所以留空</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 如果你需要把配置文件里的 url 注入给 FactoryBean，可以在这里做</span>
    }
}
