erScannerConfigurer</code>) 和 <b>Feign</b> 的核心底层原理。</p><p data-path-to-node="28"><b>有没有觉得这个模式很强大？接下来的问题是：如果我想给每个接口配置不同的 URL（比如在注解里写 <code>@MyRpcClient(url="http://...")</code>），该怎么在 Processor 里获取并传给 FactoryBean 呢？</b></p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c895538348="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c895538348-248"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c2607072150="" class="ng-tns-c2607072150-262 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2607072150="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c2607072150-262 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2607072150="" class="spacer ng-tns-c2607072150-262 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c2607072150="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c2607072150-262"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c2607072150="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c2607072150-262"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c1708826894="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><