r-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c131964840-277"><span _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="ng-tns-c131964840-277">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c131964840-277"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c131964840="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c131964840-277 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1156049544="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1156049544="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1156049544="" _nghost-ng-c1463213052="" id="message-content-id-r_e5349ab9b3a42f73" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1463213052="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_e5349ab9b3a42f73" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常实用的进阶需求。要在 <code>BeanDefinitionRegistryPostProcessor</code> 中把注解上的参数（如 <code>url</code>）传递给 <code>FactoryBean</code>，我们需要利用 <b><code>BeanDefinition</code> 的属性注入功能</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">核心思路是：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b>扫描时</b>：读取接口上 <code>@MyRpcClient</code> 注解里的 <code>url</code> 值。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b>定义时</b>：通过 <code>BeanDefinitionBuilder.addPropertyValue</code> 把这个值注入到 <code>RpcFactoryBean</code> 的属性中。</