/p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="20,4,0"><span class="citation-41"></span><b><span class="citation-41">Proxy</span></b><span class="citation-41 citation-end-41"> 最终生成的代理对象持有这个 URL，并在调用时使用。<source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1370614207=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1370614207="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="2"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3413895233=""><!----><source-inline-chips _ngcontent-ng-c3413895233="" _nghost-ng-c2631690858="" class="ng-star-inserted"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c1711370993="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1711370993="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----></source-inline-chips><!----><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="21"><span class="citation-40 citation-end-40">进阶优化（避免 Class.forName）<source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1370614207=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1370614207="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="3"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></h3><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3413895233=""><!----><source-inline-chips _ngcontent-ng-c3413895233="" _nghost-ng-c2631690858="" class="ng-star-inserted"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c1711370993="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1711370993="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----></source-inline-chips><!----><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline><p data-path-to-node="22"><span class="citation-39">上面的代码使用了 </span><code><span class="citation-39">Class.forName</span></code><span class="citation-39 citation-end-39">，这会强制 JVM 加载类。在极端严格的框架开发中（比如 Spring 内部），为了<source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1370614207=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1370614207="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="4"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span>性能和防止类加载污染，通常会使用 <b><code>MetadataReader</code></b> 直接读取字节码元数据，而不加载类。<sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3413895233=""><!----><source-inline-chips _ngcontent-ng-c3413895233="" _nghost-ng-c2631690858="" class="ng-star-inserted"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c1711370993="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1711370993="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----></source-inline-chips><!----><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="23">如果只是自己项目的中间件，上面的 <code>Class.forName</code> 写法完全足够且更易读。如果你想做得更专业，可以从 <code>beanDefinition.getMetadata()</code> 中解析注解属性 map，这样就不需要 <code>Class.forName</code> 了。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1111299064="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><overview-carousel _nghost-ng-c1158949480="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1158949480="" jslog="268370;track:generic_click,impression"><!----><!----><sources-sidebar-button _ngcontent-ng-c1158949480="" _nghost-ng-c271274336="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c271274336="" mat-stroked-button="" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base legacy-sources-sidebar-button mdc-button--outlined mat-mdc-outlined-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="262207;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c271274336="" role="img" fonticon="link" c